# Azshara - Recipes & Patterns companion (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# Only recipes, patterns, plans, schematics and formulas whose SOURCE is
# physically in Azshara (zone key 1447), verified against the local Forever
# game data (questie-forever item drop/vendor tables). Four are vendor-sold
# by the zone's two neutral gadget vendors; nineteen drop exclusively from
# in-zone mobs (each a sole in-zone dropper, zero object drops). Every
# shipped step is gated to its profession; other characters skip it cleanly.
# First Aid and Fishing have no Azshara source - stated here, not padded.
# Quest records carry no reward data, so no quest-reward recipe ships (see
# docs/companion-unverified.md). Trainer-taught staples are excluded.
# Stock class (limited vs unlimited) is not in the data; no line is marked
# limited. One recipe (Legashi Firewater) has no profession tag in the data
# and ships ungated with that disclosed.
guide butler-routes-completionist/azshara-recipes
title Azshara - Recipes & Patterns
levels 45-55
zone Azshara
faction Alliance
category Professions
folder Companions
keywords azshara, recipes, patterns, professions, companions
coords live
version 1

step Blimo Gadgetspring - dragonscale (buy)

  zone map 1447

  when skill Leatherworking 1

  vendor 12957 -- Blimo Gadgetspring (45.21,90.85)
  buy 15729 "Pattern: Chimeric Gloves"
  buy 15751 "Pattern: Blue Dragonscale Breastplate"
  buy 227898 "Pattern: Honed Blue Dragonscale Breastplate"
  note Blimo Gadgetspring (neutral) sells all three patterns at the south-east camp; nothing else in the data sells them. Stock class unconfirmed.
  note Respawn timer unconfirmed.

step Jubie Gadgetspring - deepdive helmet (buy)

  zone map 1447

  when skill Engineering 1

  vendor 8678 -- Jubie Gadgetspring (45.28,90.95)
  buy 10607 "Schematic: Deepdive Helmet"
  note Jubie Gadgetspring (neutral) sells the schematic at the south-east camp; nothing else in the data sells it. Stock class unconfirmed.
  note Respawn timer unconfirmed.

